Package: CNAppR
Title: Copy Number Alterations Analysis and Integrative Exploration
Version: 1.1.0
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Authors@R: person("Alberto", "Torrejon Aquino",
           email = "alberto.torrejon.aquino@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides re-segmentation, scoring (BCS, FCS, GCS),
    genome-wide profiling, and gene annotation for the analysis of somatic
    copy number alterations (CNAs). The package operates as a standalone R
    library without requiring a graphical interface.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
